loading: skip the disk read for experts already in the RAM cache -- the miss list only subtracted slot hits, so an expert present in RAM was still queued into blobs and pread again. On L20 a 16-token prefill routed to 7 distinct experts but issued 96 reads (13.7x), and a 40-layer prefill accumulated 14896 reads (~280GB) against 902 cached experts, which is what pinned the CPU and starved the GPU